[32m+[m[32m## Scripts[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### run_posmat_ai_actions.py[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mShell script: `bash shell_scripts/run_posmat_ai_actions.sh`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCreates a user for each CSV row, updates supported attributes, triggers the AI action flow, parses the SSE response, and writes a timestamped CSV to `output_data/`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**How it works**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Loads runtime configuration from `.env`.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Reads input rows from CSV while preserving order.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Builds an attribute catalog from the bot content JSON.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Creates a user and updates matching attributes for each row.[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Sends the trigger input to the chat endpoint and extracts the action name and output from SSE events.[m
[32m+[m[32m6. Writes ordered results to `output_data/run_posmat_ai_actions_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.csv`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Input CSV columns**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Column | Required | Description |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---|---|[m
[32m+[m[32m| `input` | Yes | User message sent to the trigger endpoint |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `trigger_input` | No | Fallback column name if `input` is empty |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `email`, `username`, `first_name`, `last_name`, `display_name`, `full_name` | No | Optional persona fields forwarded when creating the chat user |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `attr_<name>` | No | Optional attribute value mapped to bot content attribute `<name>` |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `<attribute_name>` | No | Direct attribute column when it exists in bot content |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `attributes_json` | No | JSON object of attribute overrides |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Output CSV columns**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Column | Description |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---|[m
[32m+[m[32m| `row_index` | One-based input row index |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `user_id` | User ID returned by create user |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `chat_id` | Chat ID returned by create user |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `triggered_ai_action_name` | Extracted action name from SSE events |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `ai_action_output` | Extracted action output from SSE events |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `input` | Trigger text used for the request |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**CLI options**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```powershell[m
[32m+[m[32m.venv\Scripts\python.exe run_posmat_ai_actions.py --input input_data\input.csv - run the script in Idea.[m
